    "Name": "Koschei KSC-4L",
    "Details": "Bearing the distinction of being the second Mech to be created by the Capellan Confederation, the Koschei began production in 2504 though production would cease during the Succession Wars; with production restarting during the Jihad. A 65-ton Mech, the Koschei 4L is powered by a 325-rated engine giving it a top speed of 86 km/h. An Artemis IV enhanced LRM-15 with 2 tons of ammo is the Mechs main weapon with a Large Pulse Laser and Medium Pulse Laser as backup weapons for close range combat.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Improved Lifesupport</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.09</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limit: Left Upper</color>",
